From 47f8d25799298a55c8801e528f9f3f5656d51d7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Grahmann <lars.grahmann@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:19:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/30] tests: Add offline tests for the synaptics_tudor TLS
 client

Fixed vectors made by an independent python implementation cover the
PRF, the record layer with sequence numbers, tampering and wrong
sequence, the whole client handshake against a real server flight
recorded from the vendor driver, the 70 byte signature form, the host
certificate and the pairing file. Also adds the umockdev test scaffold
(without a recording yet) and tudor-session for hardware runs.
